; Regression test for GitHub issue #3314: a virtual posting in
; (parentheses) belongs to neither group of postings that must balance,
; so a cost written on it no longer keeps the real postings from
; implying their own exchange rate, here $150 a share.

2020-01-04 Buy shares, noting their price in euros
    Assets:Brokerage                    10 AAPL
    Assets:Checking                  $-1500.00
    (Memo:Euros)                    1250.00 EUR @ $1.20

test bal --flat --basis
            $1500.00  Assets:Brokerage
           $-1500.00  Assets:Checking
            $1500.00  Memo:Euros
--------------------
            $1500.00
end test
